    "describe_ch": "運用服務設計的方法，討論服務創新應用的案例與可行作法，並藉由智慧資產的理論、實務案例說明，協助了解與認識科技發展與創新應用中，智慧資產的應用情境與重要性。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course, we look closely at the organizational challenges of innovation. We use service design concept to discuss the implement of innovation in practice. Furthermore, provide an understanding of the intellectual property issues regarding to innovation.",
